32Z"}],"body":"<h2 align=\"center\">What's Changed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">At this release we have improved the macOS transparency/blur for system tabs and the native scrollbar.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n    <video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee396524-0e88-4217-a78d-b76b9e26c064\" width=\"600\" controls></video>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* fix: soften system tab glass in macOS by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3649\r\n* fix: let macOS scrollbars follow the rendered background alpha by @falcucci in https://github.com/neovide/neovide/pull/3650\r\n\r\n\r\nNeovide will always be free and open-source.\r\n\r\n[Sponsorship](https://github.com/sponsors/neovide) is highly appreciated.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/neovide/neovide/compare/0.17.3...0.17.4","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":1}
